<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://musicbrainz.org/ns/itunes/1.0#">
<body><div>
<p begin="0:00:09.000" end="0:00:13.200"><span begin="0:00:09.000" end="0:00:12.780">前奏圆点会在这九秒里呼吸</span></p>
<p begin="0:00:14.200" end="0:00:17.600"><span begin="0:00:14.200" end="0:00:17.260">第二行紧跟着唱起来</span></p>
<p begin="0:00:18.000" end="0:00:21.000"><span begin="0:00:18.000" end="0:00:19.350">间隔短一点 </span><span begin="0:00:19.350" end="0:00:20.700">刚度会更高</span></p>
<p begin="0:00:21.800" end="0:00:24.200"><span begin="0:00:21.800" end="0:00:23.960">这一句稍微长一些,词也多一些</span></p>
<p begin="0:00:24.400" end="0:00:27.200"><span begin="0:00:24.400" end="0:00:26.920">短句</span></p>
<p begin="0:00:27.500" end="0:00:27.700"><span begin="0:00:27.500" end="0:00:27.660">急促的一行</span></p>
<p begin="0:00:27.800" end="0:00:31.400"><span begin="0:00:27.800" end="0:00:31.040">倒数节奏开始密集</span></p>
<p begin="0:00:32.800" end="0:00:39.000"><span begin="0:00:32.800" end="0:00:36.295">间奏前的最后一行 </span><span begin="0:00:36.295" end="0:00:38.480">唱完就休息</span></p>
<p begin="0:00:51.000" end="0:00:55.600"><span begin="0:00:51.000" end="0:00:55.140">间奏之后归来</span></p>
<p begin="0:00:55.900" end="0:01:00.100"><span begin="0:00:55.900" end="0:00:59.680">倒数第二行</span></p>
<p begin="0:01:00.400" end="0:01:05.400"><span begin="0:01:00.400" end="0:01:04.900">最后一行唱完就结束了</span></p>
</div></body></tt>
